     "field": "note",
     "from": null,
     "to": "Unitree Go2 page comparison table (EDU column, checked 2026-11-17): 70 x 31 x 40 cm, about 15 kg, payload about 8 kg (max ~12 kg), 0-3.7 m/s (max ~5 m/s), 12 joint motors, long-endurance 15000 mAh battery, about 2-4 h (2 h recorded is the lower bound), foot-end force sensor, depth camera, secondary development supported; optional Orin module 40-100 TOPS. Only EDU supports the full SDK and secondary development."
